m forgotten pages and scratched panels, the Coalition of Strokes was born\u2014a union of characters from diverse styles and genres, united by a single call: to protect creative essence. They do not fight alone. Beside them stand the Image Guides\u2014players from the real world capable of channeling the power of imagination, summoning cards that turn ideas into actions, and art into power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each duel in Decktoon is a battle for the survival of art. A clash between creative freedom and mechanical standardization. And although the Machines evolve with every encounter, their logic will never predict the beauty of improvisation, of mistakes, and of inspiration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decktoon is not just a card game. It\u2019s a movement. A resistance. A revolution of strokes, colors, and narratives.</p>","developers":["Guara Entretenimento","Rocpain Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903170/f3e97fa2104cf88a8d8a34529c79ae504260a8ba/header.jpg?t=1758551006","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903170/1875353988/3be4761536b1b5ae730575b3da535be1470bda53/1757281306/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757282167","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903170/1875353988/3be4761536b1b5ae730575b3da535be1470bda53/1757281306/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757282167","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3903170/1875353988/3be